(5923406, 864054, 106910, '<td valign="top">I like this - I just wanted more out of it. The keys are more silhouette than anything and the background''s color seems to overpower the front. Technically good.</td>', 'I like this - I just wanted more out of it. The keys are more silhouette than anything and the background''s color seems to overpower the front. Technically good.', '2010-03-31 11:00:28.000000', NULL, 1),
