(5923440, 863772, 106910, '<td valign="top">From this view, the tree looks like it could be in the wall, and on second glance it doesn''t seem to be in the wall. The lighting is very dark and just makes the shot bland - and I can tell from the bottom stone that the colors could be very striking.</td>', 'From this view, the tree looks like it could be in the wall, and on second glance it doesn''t seem to be in the wall. The lighting is very dark and just makes the shot bland - and I can tell from the bottom stone that the colors could be very striking.', '2010-03-31 11:24:54.000000', NULL, 1),
