(5923630, 863975, 10785, '<td valign="top">Great texture! I am assuming this is HDR, though I don''t know a lot about HDR processing so I can''t really comment to that. I do however like the perspective. The pillars look gigantic compared to the door!</td>', 'Great texture! I am assuming this is HDR, though I don''t know a lot about HDR processing so I can''t really comment to that. I do however like the perspective. The pillars look gigantic compared to the door!', '2010-03-31 14:15:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5923634, 863804, 10785, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting on this. It also shows off good textures and great use of vertical lines throughout with the horizontal lines denoting the bridge.<br/> <br/>I think the little entrance sign at the mid right background is cool with the arrow. It would have been good to get more of it in the photo if possible. On the left edge you have an object that should have either been cropped out or ommitted by taking a step or two forward. It''s too blurry and takes away from the nice sharp and crisp aspects of this photo. It doesn''t do too bad as a frame if that''s what you were going after with the entire foreground being OOF.</td>', 'I like the lighting on this. It also shows off good textures and great use of vertical lines throughout with the horizontal lines denoting the bridge. I think the little entrance sign at the mid right background is cool with the arrow. It would have been good to get more of it in the photo if possible. On the left edge you have an object that should have either been cropped out or ommitted by taking a step or two forward. It''s too blurry and takes away from the nice sharp and crisp aspects of this photo. It doesn''t do too bad as a frame if that''s what you were going after with the entire foreground being OOF.', '2010-03-31 14:21:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5923635, 864010, 111123, '<td valign="top">Great picture, love the color....9!</td>', 'Great picture, love the color....9!', '2010-03-31 14:22:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5923636, 863934, 10785, '<td valign="top">I thought everything was big in Texas!! That''s one small cottage! Very good color photo with added interest of a person entering in.</td>', 'I thought everything was big in Texas!! That''s one small cottage! Very good color photo with added interest of a person entering in.', '2010-03-31 14:22:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5923638, 863986, 106910, '<td valign="top">I''m just not sure what I dislike about the photo, but it''s really not a bad one at all. It''s sharp and has nice colors... but still, there''s something that I can''t put my finger on. 6</td>', 'I''m just not sure what I dislike about the photo, but it''s really not a bad one at all. It''s sharp and has nice colors... but still, there''s something that I can''t put my finger on. 6', '2010-03-31 14:25:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5923639, 863775, 10785, '<td valign="top">I like the textures shown and the vivid color and the perspective shot. I wonder why didn''t you use a horizontal crop with the diagonal perspective moving in a horizontal fashion? I suppose that is a matter of taste.</td>', 'I like the textures shown and the vivid color and the perspective shot. I wonder why didn''t you use a horizontal crop with the diagonal perspective moving in a horizontal fashion? I suppose that is a matter of taste.', '2010-03-31 14:25:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5923641, 863888, 10785, '<td valign="top">Nice Depth of field. I like the muted tones here with the neutral colors.</td>', 'Nice Depth of field. I like the muted tones here with the neutral colors.', '2010-03-31 14:26:36.000000', NULL, 1),
