(5924157, 864051, 102163, '<td valign="top">Love how the light works to bring the focus to under the bridge, and I like the framing. The color is subtle but interesting. My only negative is maybe the lights on the left side that are slightly distracting, but if there wre more editing that would be simple to fix.</td>', 'Love how the light works to bring the focus to under the bridge, and I like the framing. The color is subtle but interesting. My only negative is maybe the lights on the left side that are slightly distracting, but if there wre more editing that would be simple to fix.', '2010-03-31 22:47:07.000000', NULL, 1),
