(5924161, 863253, 102163, '<td valign="top">Love the lighting and the background, but the hand kind of looks like it''s floating which is strange. I still like it though.</td>', 'Love the lighting and the background, but the hand kind of looks like it''s floating which is strange. I still like it though.', '2010-03-31 22:49:27.000000', NULL, 1),
