(5925038, 863926, 104198, '<td valign="top">Creative, out of the box thinking!  Not only do I like the idea, but the photo itself seems to be well executed.  A bit soft around the edges, but I am not sure if 100% sharpness would have been any better! gets a 9 from my camp!</td>', 'Creative, out of the box thinking!  Not only do I like the idea, but the photo itself seems to be well executed.  A bit soft around the edges, but I am not sure if 100% sharpness would have been any better! gets a 9 from my camp!', '2010-04-01 09:29:15.000000', NULL, 1),
