(5925345, 863756, 116052, '<td valign="top">This picture has great potential. I would have cropped it differently.<br/>The tree is distracting, so are the upper windows.<br/>The carpet would have had a bigger effect if it didn''t have an end.</td>', 'This picture has great potential. I would have cropped it differently.The tree is distracting, so are the upper windows.The carpet would have had a bigger effect if it didn''t have an end.', '2010-04-01 12:03:44.000000', NULL, 1),
