(5925507, 862975, 103310, '<td valign="top">Geef hier uw commentaar, en vervolgens uw stem uit ...</td>', 'Geef hier uw commentaar, en vervolgens uw stem uit ...', '2010-04-01 13:09:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5925514, 864015, 10785, '<td valign="top">You denoted the entrance well with the gate across the canal. The canal wall and the bollards are leading your eye down the canal but there is the horizontal bar across the picture closing down access. It''s kind of unique in composition that way because my eyes want to follow the leading lines into the background but they keep hitting the gate and coming back into the foreground.<br/> <br/>I like the line of the buildings in the background with the varied roof structures and windows creating interesting patterns and rhythm.<br/> <br/>The gate is really sharp and crisp, but the sharpness seems to fall off into the background. Overall there are rich colors due to good exposure.</td>', 'You denoted the entrance well with the gate across the canal. The canal wall and the bollards are leading your eye down the canal but there is the horizontal bar across the picture closing down access. It''s kind of unique in composition that way because my eyes want to follow the leading lines into the background but they keep hitting the gate and coming back into the foreground. I like the line of the buildings in the background with the varied roof structures and windows creating interesting patterns and rhythm. The gate is really sharp and crisp, but the sharpness seems to fall off into the background. Overall there are rich colors due to good exposure.', '2010-04-01 13:12:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5925517, 864054, 103310, '<td valign="top">Strongly by simplicity.<br/> <br/>Through the good use of DOF with an acerbity at the correct place the keys which must allow the entrance get, all attention.<br/> <br/>Strong compositie</td>', 'Strongly by simplicity. Through the good use of DOF with an acerbity at the correct place the keys which must allow the entrance get, all attention. Strong compositie', '2010-04-01 13:13:20.000000', NULL, 1),
