(5925696, 863571, 10785, '<td valign="top">Great capture of Shadows and Light. The arches are superb shapes and lead you right through to the door. I would totally hang this on my wall.</td>', 'Great capture of Shadows and Light. The arches are superb shapes and lead you right through to the door. I would totally hang this on my wall.', '2010-04-01 14:13:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5925710, 863757, 83313, '<td valign="top">They must have just had an earthquake, as I see the horizon is tilted. Watch your JPEG compression levels when you save. I see some compression artifacts around the high contrast edges of the bridge, and a 95k file size confirms you used way too much compression for the scene. Compression kills detail. Always use the least amount of compression you can and still come in under the challenge limit.</td>', 'They must have just had an earthquake, as I see the horizon is tilted. Watch your JPEG compression levels when you save. I see some compression artifacts around the high contrast edges of the bridge, and a 95k file size confirms you used way too much compression for the scene. Compression kills detail. Always use the least amount of compression you can and still come in under the challenge limit.', '2010-04-01 14:30:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5925715, 864029, 83313, '<td valign="top">Kind of a snapshot to be honest. Harsh lighting and it really does not make the food look appetizing at all. The idea has lots of potential, however.</td>', 'Kind of a snapshot to be honest. Harsh lighting and it really does not make the food look appetizing at all. The idea has lots of potential, however.', '2010-04-01 14:35:25.000000', NULL, 1),
