(5927469, 864048, 83313, '<td valign="top">Certainly fits the challenge, but I''m afraid the image comes off to me as very flat and uninteresting. Some elements, such as the branches/roots seem oversharpened. Not sure what to suggest other that maybe a different perspective for the shot.</td>', 'Certainly fits the challenge, but I''m afraid the image comes off to me as very flat and uninteresting. Some elements, such as the branches/roots seem oversharpened. Not sure what to suggest other that maybe a different perspective for the shot.', '2010-04-02 13:57:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5927472, 863914, 83313, '<td valign="top">Lot''s of impact to this one. The title suggests to me that this is on a college campus. I like the composition. Oftentimes, cutting of the subject at frame edge does not work well, but I think it serves this one well. It''s as if I was heading for the doorway when this bulldog jumped out in my path to stop me.</td>', 'Lot''s of impact to this one. The title suggests to me that this is on a college campus. I like the composition. Oftentimes, cutting of the subject at frame edge does not work well, but I think it serves this one well. It''s as if I was heading for the doorway when this bulldog jumped out in my path to stop me.', '2010-04-02 14:00:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5927474, 863975, 83313, '<td valign="top">This has a very Jebbish look to it. A look that I like and often try to do myself, with varying rates of success. If this entry is not from <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=63398" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">NikonJeb</a>, then please take that as a compliment.</td>', 'This has a very Jebbish look to it. A look that I like and often try to do myself, with varying rates of success. If this entry is not from  NikonJeb, then please take that as a compliment.', '2010-04-02 14:03:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5927479, 863934, 83313, '<td valign="top">The real estate agent described this place as "cozy". I do realize that is marketing speak for "small", but this is ludicrous! Gotta admit, I do like the location, though.</td>', 'The real estate agent described this place as "cozy". I do realize that is marketing speak for "small", but this is ludicrous! Gotta admit, I do like the location, though.', '2010-04-02 14:08:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5927481, 864069, 83313, '<td valign="top">I''m dizzy already. Guessing this may be a <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=106349" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Tammster</a> entry, because she has lot''s of lighthouses nearby and a new wideangle lens.</td>', 'I''m dizzy already. Guessing this may be a  Tammster entry, because she has lot''s of lighthouses nearby and a new wideangle lens.', '2010-04-02 14:13:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5927483, 863997, 83313, '<td valign="top">Very cool looking. Extremely abstract, but there are recognizable doors, or at least what looks like doors. I expect this is going to get creamed in voting, just because that is the usual fate of abstracts in a non-abstract challenge. I like it a lot, however.</td>', 'Very cool looking. Extremely abstract, but there are recognizable doors, or at least what looks like doors. I expect this is going to get creamed in voting, just because that is the usual fate of abstracts in a non-abstract challenge. I like it a lot, however.', '2010-04-02 14:16:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5927486, 863432, 83313, '<td valign="top">A good snapshot, but a bit busy for me. All the stuff in the background tends to pull my gaze away from the real subject.</td>', 'A good snapshot, but a bit busy for me. All the stuff in the background tends to pull my gaze away from the real subject.', '2010-04-02 14:17:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5927488, 863800, 83313, '<td valign="top">Not caring for this, I''m afraid. I find it cropped a little tight and the light sepia treatment does not work for me. For such a subject, I enjoy seeing the detail pop out at me.</td>', 'Not caring for this, I''m afraid. I find it cropped a little tight and the light sepia treatment does not work for me. For such a subject, I enjoy seeing the detail pop out at me.', '2010-04-02 14:19:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5927493, 864046, 83313, '<td valign="top">The patterns of the building are interesting and event the odd perspective view seems to work. It does come off to me as a bit flat looking, however. I copied it into PaintShop Pro to see, and found a quick adjustment of levels and curves made a huge difference.</td>', 'The patterns of the building are interesting and event the odd perspective view seems to work. It does come off to me as a bit flat looking, however. I copied it into PaintShop Pro to see, and found a quick adjustment of levels and curves made a huge difference.', '2010-04-02 14:23:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5927499, 863860, 83313, '<td valign="top">Normally shots of computer screens fare pretty badly and deservedly so, but I think you approached the idea in a very effective manner. The selective focus and slight angle work for this, and you composed it so that my eye is led to address field. A high vote for this one, because you effectively pulled off a shot that many others have failed with.</td>', 'Normally shots of computer screens fare pretty badly and deservedly so, but I think you approached the idea in a very effective manner. The selective focus and slight angle work for this, and you composed it so that my eye is led to address field. A high vote for this one, because you effectively pulled off a shot that many others have failed with.', '2010-04-02 14:31:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5927501, 863406, 83313, '<td valign="top">Grog like this cave! Cold fire things make so Grog can see painting on wall. Painting tells Grog of many battles fought and many enemies slain. Great hunter and fighter lives here.</td>', 'Grog like this cave! Cold fire things make so Grog can see painting on wall. Painting tells Grog of many battles fought and many enemies slain. Great hunter and fighter lives here.', '2010-04-02 14:36:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5927502, 863988, 83313, '<td valign="top">Seems a bit soft and fuzzy somehow. Other than that, it''s some nice rust, but that soft appearance is killing it for me.</td>', 'Seems a bit soft and fuzzy somehow. Other than that, it''s some nice rust, but that soft appearance is killing it for me.', '2010-04-02 14:37:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5927504, 863970, 83313, '<td valign="top">Great shot, and I can see the connection you are making, but I''m not sure how well it really suits the topic.</td>', 'Great shot, and I can see the connection you are making, but I''m not sure how well it really suits the topic.', '2010-04-02 14:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
