(5928123, 863787, 12796, '<td valign="top">slightly tilted?</td>', 'slightly tilted?', '2010-04-02 21:45:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5928132, 863835, 106349, '<td valign="top">Just beautiful! LOVE the wide angle shot.</td>', 'Just beautiful! LOVE the wide angle shot.', '2010-04-02 21:52:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5928135, 864054, 106349, '<td valign="top">The keys seem just a tad too dark. Otherwise, I like the DOF &amp; composition.</td>', 'The keys seem just a tad too dark. Otherwise, I like the DOF & composition.', '2010-04-02 21:53:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5928235, 863794, 111808, '<td valign="top">I REALLY had to study this to realise what it was. I am glad I took the time to do this. Very unique.</td>', 'I REALLY had to study this to realise what it was. I am glad I took the time to do this. Very unique.', '2010-04-02 23:16:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5928236, 863849, 111808, '<td valign="top">A Faery Door - I love it!</td>', 'A Faery Door - I love it!', '2010-04-02 23:17:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5928243, 863512, 111808, '<td valign="top">How very interesting that most of this shows empty shoppes. Is that what the "New Economy" will bring to us? I can only hope for a better future. Pristine, but quiet and very lonely.</td>', 'How very interesting that most of this shows empty shoppes. Is that what the "New Economy" will bring to us? I can only hope for a better future. Pristine, but quiet and very lonely.', '2010-04-02 23:20:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5928247, 863197, 111808, '<td valign="top">This is quiet and understated - but it is also a unique take on the challenge and a very good one. Doesn''t it make you wonder about the "once was" before it bricked up?</td>', 'This is quiet and understated - but it is also a unique take on the challenge and a very good one. Doesn''t it make you wonder about the "once was" before it bricked up?', '2010-04-02 23:24:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5928250, 863970, 111808, '<td valign="top">The warm golds and oranges in this create a most pleasant and peaceful feeling.<br/>It makes it nice to muse upon.</td>', 'The warm golds and oranges in this create a most pleasant and peaceful feeling.It makes it nice to muse upon.', '2010-04-02 23:29:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5928256, 863654, 111808, '<td valign="top">The black and white is really effective in making this stand out. I also like the differing yet converging lines in it, although some thought would have to be given before walking in considering the barred gate...</td>', 'The black and white is really effective in making this stand out. I also like the differing yet converging lines in it, although some thought would have to be given before walking in considering the barred gate...', '2010-04-02 23:34:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5928258, 863912, 111808, '<td valign="top">The old historic textures on this door are delightful. The contrasts with the patterned wood is superb. I like the antiquity of the broken handle standing out in sharp relief as well. Ah - but who has the key to open it?</td>', 'The old historic textures on this door are delightful. The contrasts with the patterned wood is superb. I like the antiquity of the broken handle standing out in sharp relief as well. Ah - but who has the key to open it?', '2010-04-02 23:37:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5928266, 863192, 111808, '<td valign="top">This makes me want to know what the backstory to it is - why was it condemned? By the weathered look the wood across the door it has been this way for quite awhile...The red French sign draws your eye in immediately and is echoed by the rust in the hinge and the peeling paint. Also the lumber texture contrasts nicely with the cracked rough stone around it. I do like this - and I want to know more.</td>', 'This makes me want to know what the backstory to it is - why was it condemned? By the weathered look the wood across the door it has been this way for quite awhile...The red French sign draws your eye in immediately and is echoed by the rust in the hinge and the peeling paint. Also the lumber texture contrasts nicely with the cracked rough stone around it. I do like this - and I want to know more.', '2010-04-02 23:45:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5928274, 863775, 111808, '<td valign="top">I like the colours and related tones in this. I also like the varied lines, upright for the train and windows and sideways horizonal on the ceiling.</td>', 'I like the colours and related tones in this. I also like the varied lines, upright for the train and windows and sideways horizonal on the ceiling.', '2010-04-02 23:50:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5928280, 863964, 111808, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colours, delightful &amp; dynamic horizontal slant and the white background really makes this shine. Crisp, sharp, with a promise of Spring. Superb tulip!</td>', 'Beautiful colours, delightful & dynamic horizontal slant and the white background really makes this shine. Crisp, sharp, with a promise of Spring. Superb tulip!', '2010-04-02 23:53:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5928286, 863468, 111808, '<td valign="top">The royal blue of the bird and the light colour &amp; grain of the wood house are beautiful together. The inspection phase pose is perfect.</td>', 'The royal blue of the bird and the light colour & grain of the wood house are beautiful together. The inspection phase pose is perfect.', '2010-04-02 23:57:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5928288, 863756, 111808, '<td valign="top">Look at the grandiose architecture of this building. The knights at the door perfectly frame the royal red carpet and makes this entrance inviting indeed.</td>', 'Look at the grandiose architecture of this building. The knights at the door perfectly frame the royal red carpet and makes this entrance inviting indeed.', '2010-04-02 23:58:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5928290, 863371, 111808, '<td valign="top">Is this the historic Sykesville, Maryland tunnel? It has aged character.</td>', 'Is this the historic Sykesville, Maryland tunnel? It has aged character.', '2010-04-03 00:02:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5928291, 862960, 111808, '<td valign="top">I love the title on this. It is nice to think that this road leads to just that...<br/>Also, the dancing sky patterns in this are intriguing.</td>', 'I love the title on this. It is nice to think that this road leads to just that...Also, the dancing sky patterns in this are intriguing.', '2010-04-03 00:04:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5928293, 863812, 111808, '<td valign="top">Whimsical, fun, creative - what does the royal Cat Residence look like?</td>', 'Whimsical, fun, creative - what does the royal Cat Residence look like?', '2010-04-03 00:07:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5928296, 864049, 111808, '<td valign="top">Caecum (Blind) AKA the pouch connecting the ileum with the ascending colon of the large intestine seperated by the ileocecal valve. Unique title and a unique photograph as well.</td>', 'Caecum (Blind) AKA the pouch connecting the ileum with the ascending colon of the large intestine seperated by the ileocecal valve. Unique title and a unique photograph as well.', '2010-04-03 00:11:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5928301, 863596, 111808, '<td valign="top">I love the subway ghosts in this.</td>', 'I love the subway ghosts in this.', '2010-04-03 00:19:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5928303, 863406, 111808, '<td valign="top">Very colourful wall decorations/murals. Great contrast with the almost singular sepia tones of the hallway, floor &amp; ceiling.</td>', 'Very colourful wall decorations/murals. Great contrast with the almost singular sepia tones of the hallway, floor & ceiling.', '2010-04-03 00:20:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5928305, 864070, 111808, '<td valign="top">I love the perspective distortion of the climber - makes her look very long legged. The sweeping and repeating curves of the white stairs makes this engaging.</td>', 'I love the perspective distortion of the climber - makes her look very long legged. The sweeping and repeating curves of the white stairs makes this engaging.', '2010-04-03 00:23:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5928307, 863617, 111808, '<td valign="top">I like this - the grey tones &amp; silvers blend together well but they also contrast enough to bring out the detailled work of the door and the framing Angels. The Angel of Summer holds Promise, the Angel of Autumn weeps.</td>', 'I like this - the grey tones & silvers blend together well but they also contrast enough to bring out the detailled work of the door and the framing Angels. The Angel of Summer holds Promise, the Angel of Autumn weeps.', '2010-04-03 00:29:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5928309, 864043, 111808, '<td valign="top">Atlanta style Skel - love that unique decor.</td>', 'Atlanta style Skel - love that unique decor.', '2010-04-03 00:32:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5928312, 864074, 111808, '<td valign="top">This looks very inviting. I like how the rich colour of the long languid wooden door contrasts with the darker bricks and the weathered stairs and the green door so close by. The curve of the dormer window above it is echoed by the curved brick patterns of the tall upright - pleasing shapes. Squares, curves, reflections, this rich photograph has it all.</td>', 'This looks very inviting. I like how the rich colour of the long languid wooden door contrasts with the darker bricks and the weathered stairs and the green door so close by. The curve of the dormer window above it is echoed by the curved brick patterns of the tall upright - pleasing shapes. Squares, curves, reflections, this rich photograph has it all.', '2010-04-03 00:40:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5928416, 863192, 61396, '<td valign="top">I like how the reds work together</td>', 'I like how the reds work together', '2010-04-03 05:16:13.000000', NULL, 1),
