(5930837, 864029, 25773, '<td valign="top">I guess, it is rather entrance to your stomach, but still a nice concept and composition. However, there are some major problems that in my eyes prevent the message suggested by the title to go through. Technically, it feels underexposed (probably because of the bright reflections of the flash) and the colors are somewhat washed out. Also, in this particular case the pin-sharp little details are rather distracting. A thorough makeup and manicure for the model would also make it more effective (IMHO).</td>', 'I guess, it is rather entrance to your stomach, but still a nice concept and composition. However, there are some major problems that in my eyes prevent the message suggested by the title to go through. Technically, it feels underexposed (probably because of the bright reflections of the flash) and the colors are somewhat washed out. Also, in this particular case the pin-sharp little details are rather distracting. A thorough makeup and manicure for the model would also make it more effective (IMHO).', '2010-04-05 01:19:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5930841, 863812, 25773, '<td valign="top">Clever concept. Would be better with an actual mouse:).</td>', 'Clever concept. Would be better with an actual mouse:).', '2010-04-05 01:21:15.000000', NULL, 1),
