(5934525, 863914, 61961, '<td valign="top">I think this was somewhat underrated by voters.  I liked how the statue was dominant and the entrance barely visible but obviously the two were connected.  I''m glad I didn''t see your crazy title during voting. ;-)</td>', 'I think this was somewhat underrated by voters.  I liked how the statue was dominant and the entrance barely visible but obviously the two were connected.  I''m glad I didn''t see your crazy title during voting. ;-)', '2010-04-07 01:47:30.000000', NULL, 0),
