(5934533, 863997, 83313, '<td valign="top">Yup, I thought this was yours from your remarks in the scores thread shortly after I had faved it. In spite of the overall low average, I can see from the comments and voting breakdown that it found it''s fans. In spite of a majority that does not care for abstract photography, I''d call this a success.</td>', 'Yup, I thought this was yours from your remarks in the scores thread shortly after I had faved it. In spite of the overall low average, I can see from the comments and voting breakdown that it found it''s fans. In spite of a majority that does not care for abstract photography, I''d call this a success.', '2010-04-07 01:55:05.000000', NULL, 0),
