(5935053, 864008, 98339, '<td valign="top">I gave you a 7 for this...Although it took me a little while to ready the sign and "get" the picture...I did get it...and the gray sky didn''t bother me because of the sign...maybe if you could have seen a little more of the sign (just a touch)...but I got the picture...or so I thought I did...</td>', 'I gave you a 7 for this...Although it took me a little while to ready the sign and "get" the picture...I did get it...and the gray sky didn''t bother me because of the sign...maybe if you could have seen a little more of the sign (just a touch)...but I got the picture...or so I thought I did...', '2010-04-07 10:18:40.000000', NULL, 0),
